  "description": "Upgrade your Dodge Ram with the OEDRO Low-profile Hard Quad-Fold Tonneau Cover—built for durability, security, and style. Custom-fit for 2009-2018 Dodge Ram 150 & 2019-2024 Dodge Ram 1500 Classic & 2010-2026 Dodge Ram 2500 3500 6.4ft beds, this cover features tough fiberglass-reinforced panels that stand up to weather, impact, and daily use. The sleek, low-profile design enhances your truck's look while keeping your cargo safe from rain, snow, and theft. With no drilling required, you’ll be up and running in minutes. Plus, the included LED bed light adds visibility exactly when you need it. Whether you're hauling tools or heading out for adventure, trust OEDRO to protect what you carry.\nFeatures\nLow-Profile Quad-Fold Design: Sleek flush-mount appearance delivers a clean, modern look while providing flexible and convenient truck bed access.\nHeavy-Duty FRP & Aluminum Construction: Reinforced fiberglass (FRP) panels paired with a durable aluminum alloy frame provide excellent strength, impact resistance, and long-lasting performance.\nQuick & Easy No-Drill Installation: Designed for secure clamp-on installation with no drilling required. Includes detailed instructions for fast setup. (Cargo racks must be removed before installation.)\nEnhanced Weather Protection: Integrated sealing system helps protect cargo against rain, dirt, snow, and harmful UV exposure for dependable all-weather performance.\nSecure & Functional Design: Quad-fold structure allows partial or full bed access while maintaining stability and cargo security during travel.\n1-Year Warranty | Professional installation is recommended for optimal fitment and performance.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2009-2018 Dodge Ram 1500 with 6.4 Feet Bed\nCompatible with 2019-2024 Dodge Ram 1500 Classic with 6.4 Feet Bed\nCompatible with 2010-2026 Dodge Ram 2500 3500 with 6.4 Feet Bed",
